#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: live-chat-for-freescout.php
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:83
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:84
msgid "Live Chat for FreeScout"
msgstr "Live Chat for FreeScout"

#. Description of the plugin
#: live-chat-for-freescout.php
msgid "Adds a live chat bubble to your site that delivers visitor messages to your FreeScout help desk."
msgstr "Fügt Ihrer Website einen Live-Chat-Button hinzu und leitet die Nachrichten der Besucher an Ihren FreeScout-Helpdesk weiter."

#: includes/class-lcff-appearance.php:141
#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:63
msgid "Chat with us"
msgstr "Chatten Sie mit uns"

#: includes/class-lcff-appearance.php:143
msgid "Hi! How can we help?"
msgstr "Hallo! Wie können wir Ihnen helfen?"

#: includes/class-lcff-appearance.php:144
msgid "We're away right now. Leave a message and we'll answer by email."
msgstr "Wir sind gerade nicht erreichbar. Hinterlassen Sie uns eine Nachricht, dann antworten wir Ihnen per E-Mail."

#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:64
msgid "Save the FreeScout URL and Site ID first."
msgstr "Speichern Sie zuerst die FreeScout-URL und die Website-ID."

#. translators: %s: the error from the HTTP request
#. translators: %s: the error from the request
#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:114
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:113
#, php-format
msgid "Couldn't reach FreeScout: %s"
msgstr "FreeScout ist nicht erreichbar: %s"

#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:123
msgid "FreeScout knows this Site ID, but the secret doesn't match. Copy the secret again from FreeScout."
msgstr "FreeScout kennt diese Website-ID, aber der geheime Schlüssel stimmt nicht überein. Kopieren Sie den geheimen Schlüssel erneut aus FreeScout."

#. translators: 1: the website address FreeScout expects, 2: this website's address
#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:129
#, php-format
msgid "FreeScout expects this website at %1$s, but this site's address is %2$s. Correct the address in FreeScout under Manage → Website Chat."
msgstr "FreeScout erwartet diese Website unter %1$s, ihre Adresse lautet aber %2$s. Korrigieren Sie die Adresse in FreeScout unter Verwalten → Website-Chat."

#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:131
msgid "Connected. FreeScout accepted the Site ID and the secret."
msgstr "Verbunden. FreeScout hat die Website-ID und den geheimen Schlüssel akzeptiert."

#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:134
msgid "Connected. No secret is saved, so logged-in visitors and order numbers won't be recognized."
msgstr "Verbunden. Es ist kein geheimer Schlüssel gespeichert, daher werden angemeldete Besucher und Bestellnummern nicht erkannt."

#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:137
msgid "FreeScout doesn't know this Site ID. Check it under Manage → Website Chat."
msgstr "FreeScout kennt diese Website-ID nicht. Überprüfen Sie sie unter Verwalten → Website-Chat."

#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:139
msgid "FreeScout needs a database update first (System → Tools → Migrate DB)."
msgstr "FreeScout benötigt zuerst ein Datenbank-Update (System → Werkzeuge → Datenbank migrieren)."

#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:141
msgid "Too many tests. Try again in a minute."
msgstr "Zu viele Tests. Versuchen Sie es in einer Minute erneut."

#. translators: %d: the HTTP status code
#: includes/class-lcff-connection.php:145
#, php-format
msgid "FreeScout answered, but not as expected (HTTP %d). Is the Website Chat module installed and active?"
msgstr "FreeScout hat geantwortet, aber nicht wie erwartet (HTTP %d). Ist das Website-Chat-Modul installiert und aktiviert?"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:107
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:266
msgid "Choose an avatar"
msgstr "Avatar auswählen"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:108
msgid "Use this image"
msgstr "Dieses Bild verwenden"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:138
msgid "FreeScout URL"
msgstr "FreeScout-URL"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:146
msgid "The address of your FreeScout installation."
msgstr "Die Adresse Ihrer FreeScout-Installation."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:152
msgid "Site ID"
msgstr "Website-ID"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:160
msgid "The 32-character site ID, shown in FreeScout under Manage → Website Chat when you open your website."
msgstr "Die 32-stellige Website-ID. FreeScout zeigt sie unter Verwalten → Website-Chat an, wenn Sie dort Ihre Website öffnen."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:166
msgid "Secret"
msgstr "Geheimer Schlüssel"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:174
msgid "The 43-character site secret from FreeScout. It lets logged-in visitors and order numbers be recognized. Leave blank to keep the saved value."
msgstr "Der 43-stellige geheime Schlüssel der Website aus FreeScout. Damit werden angemeldete Besucher und Bestellnummern erkannt. Lassen Sie das Feld leer, um den gespeicherten Wert zu behalten."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:180
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Darstellung"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:186
msgid "Team name"
msgstr "Teamname"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:187
msgid "Avatar"
msgstr "Avatar"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:188
msgid "Accent color"
msgstr "Akzentfarbe"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:189
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Position"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:190
msgid "Welcome message"
msgstr "Begrüßungsnachricht"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:191
msgid "Welcome message (away)"
msgstr "Begrüßungsnachricht (außerhalb der Servicezeiten)"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:192
msgid "Hide on pages"
msgstr "Auf folgenden Seiten ausblenden"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:192
msgid "One path per line, e.g. /checkout/. A line ending in * hides the chat on every page below it."
msgstr "Ein Pfad pro Zeile, z. B. /checkout/. Eine Zeile, die auf * endet, blendet den Chat auf allen Seiten darunter aus."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:193
msgid "Privacy policy link"
msgstr "Link zur Datenschutzerklärung"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:193
msgid "Leave empty to use the WordPress privacy page."
msgstr "Lassen Sie das Feld leer, um die in WordPress festgelegte Seite für die Datenschutzerklärung zu verwenden."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:197
msgid "Working hours"
msgstr "Servicezeiten"

#. translators: Checkbox after a weekday in the working hours: the chat is open on that day.
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:233
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Geöffnet"

#. translators: Label before the opening time of a day ("from 09:00").
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:235
msgid "from"
msgstr "von"

#. translators: Label before the closing time of a day ("to 17:00").
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:237
msgid "to"
msgstr "bis"

#. translators: %s: the site's timezone, e.g. Europe/Berlin or +02:00
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:242
#, php-format
msgid "Times use the site's timezone (%s)."
msgstr "Die Zeiten beziehen sich auf die Zeitzone der Website (%s)."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:267
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Entfernen"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:280
msgid "Bottom right"
msgstr "Unten rechts"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:281
msgid "Bottom left"
msgstr "Unten links"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:326
msgid "Your site uses HTTPS, so the FreeScout URL must start with https://."
msgstr "Ihre Website verwendet HTTPS, daher muss die FreeScout-URL mit https:// beginnen."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:328
msgid "The FreeScout URL is not valid."
msgstr "Die FreeScout-URL ist ungültig."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:339
msgid "The Site ID must be 32 lowercase hexadecimal characters."
msgstr "Die Website-ID muss aus 32 kleingeschriebenen Hexadezimalzeichen bestehen."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:347
msgid "The secret must be 43 characters: letters, digits, \"-\" and \"_\"."
msgstr "Der geheime Schlüssel muss aus 43 Zeichen bestehen: Buchstaben, Ziffern, „-“ und „_“."

#. translators: %s: the day of the week
#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:362
#, php-format
msgid "Working hours for %s: the end must be later than the start. The day was saved as closed."
msgstr "Servicezeiten am %s: Das Ende muss nach dem Beginn liegen. Der Tag wurde als geschlossen gespeichert."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:438
msgid "Monday"
msgstr "Montag"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:439
msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "Dienstag"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:440
msgid "Wednesday"
msgstr "Mittwoch"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:441
msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "Donnerstag"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:442
msgid "Friday"
msgstr "Freitag"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:443
msgid "Saturday"
msgstr "Samstag"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:444
msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "Sonntag"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:512
msgid "Saved — leave blank to keep"
msgstr "Gespeichert – zum Beibehalten leer lassen"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:523
msgid "The saved secret is not valid. Paste it again from FreeScout."
msgstr "Der gespeicherte geheime Schlüssel ist ungültig. Fügen Sie ihn erneut aus FreeScout ein."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:530
msgid "Remove the saved secret"
msgstr "Gespeicherten geheimen Schlüssel entfernen"

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:533
msgid "This server's PHP can't encrypt with AES-256-GCM (OpenSSL), so logged-in visitors and order numbers can't be recognized."
msgstr "Das PHP auf diesem Server kann nicht mit AES-256-GCM (OpenSSL) verschlüsseln, daher können angemeldete Besucher und Bestellnummern nicht erkannt werden."

#: includes/class-lcff-settings.php:553
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Verbindung testen"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:64
msgid "Type a message…"
msgstr "Nachricht schreiben …"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:65
msgid "Send"
msgstr "Senden"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:66
msgid "Close chat"
msgstr "Chat schließen"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:67
msgid "Couldn't send. Tap to retry."
msgstr "Nicht gesendet. Zum erneuten Senden antippen."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:68
msgid "This message couldn't be sent."
msgstr "Diese Nachricht konnte nicht gesendet werden."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:69
msgid "Attach a file"
msgstr "Datei anhängen"

#. translators: {mb} is replaced in the browser with the size limit in megabytes, e.g. 10. Keep {mb} as it is.
#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:71
msgid "This file is too large (max {mb} MB)."
msgstr "Diese Datei ist zu groß (max. {mb} MB)."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:72
msgid "This file is too large."
msgstr "Diese Datei ist zu groß."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:73
msgid "Only images (JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP) and PDF files can be sent."
msgstr "Es können nur Bilder (JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP) und PDF-Dateien gesendet werden."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:74
msgid "Couldn't send the file."
msgstr "Die Datei konnte nicht gesendet werden."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:75
msgid "Couldn't load the file."
msgstr "Die Datei konnte nicht geladen werden."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:76
msgid "We usually reply within a few minutes. If you leave the page, we'll send the answer by email."
msgstr "Wir antworten meist innerhalb weniger Minuten. Wenn Sie die Seite verlassen, schicken wir Ihnen die Antwort per E-Mail."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:77
msgid "Email or order no."
msgstr "E-Mail oder Bestellnr."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:78
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-Mail"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:79
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:80
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "Jetzt nicht"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:81
msgid "Where should we send the answer?"
msgstr "Wohin sollen wir Ihnen die Antwort schicken?"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:82
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "Danke!"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:83
msgid "Could you leave your email address? Then we can send you the answer."
msgstr "Möchten Sie uns Ihre E-Mail-Adresse hinterlassen? Dann können wir Ihnen die Antwort schicken."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:84
msgid "Please enter a valid email address."
msgstr "Bitte geben Sie eine gültige E-Mail-Adresse ein."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:85
msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Datenschutzerklärung"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:86
msgid "This conversation continues by email. The link in our email brings you back here."
msgstr "Dieses Gespräch wird per E-Mail fortgesetzt. Über den Link in unserer E-Mail kommen Sie hierher zurück."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:87
msgid "This conversation now continues in another browser."
msgstr "Dieses Gespräch wird jetzt in einem anderen Browser fortgesetzt."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:88
msgid "Continue your conversation here?"
msgstr "Möchten Sie das Gespräch hier fortsetzen?"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:89
msgid "Continue chat"
msgstr "Chat fortsetzen"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:90
msgid "This link has expired or was already used."
msgstr "Dieser Link ist abgelaufen oder wurde bereits verwendet."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:91
msgid "The chat couldn't be opened. Please try again."
msgstr "Der Chat konnte nicht geöffnet werden. Bitte versuchen Sie es noch einmal."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:92
msgid "Online · usually replies in a few minutes"
msgstr "Online · Antwort meist innerhalb weniger Minuten"

#. translators: Header status while the chat is closed. {time} is replaced in the browser with today's opening time in the site language, e.g. 09:00. Keep {time} as it is.
#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:94
msgid "Back today {time} · we'll answer by email"
msgstr "Heute ab {time} Uhr wieder erreichbar · wir antworten Ihnen per E-Mail"

#. translators: Header status while the chat is closed. {day} is replaced in the browser with the weekday name in the site language, e.g. Monday; {time} with the opening time, e.g. 09:00. Keep {day} and {time} as they are.
#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:96
msgid "Back {day} {time} · we'll answer by email"
msgstr "Ab {day}, {time} Uhr wieder erreichbar · wir antworten Ihnen per E-Mail"

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:97
msgid "Too many messages in a short time. Please wait a moment."
msgstr "Zu viele Nachrichten in kurzer Zeit. Bitte warten Sie einen Moment."

#. translators: Shown when the wait is longer than 90 seconds. {min} is replaced in the browser with the number of minutes to wait, e.g. 60 (always 2 or more). Keep {min} as it is.
#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:99
msgid "Too many messages in a short time. Please try again in {min} minutes."
msgstr "Zu viele Nachrichten in kurzer Zeit. Bitte versuchen Sie es in {min} Minuten noch einmal."

#. translators: Added after the reason why a chat message wasn't sent (e.g. too many messages); the visitor taps the message to send it again.
#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:101
msgid "Tap to resend."
msgstr "Zum erneuten Senden antippen."

#: includes/class-lcff-widget.php:102
msgid "via email"
msgstr "per E-Mail"

#. translators: %s: the host name of the FreeScout help desk, e.g. help.example.com.
#: includes/class-lcff-privacy.php:43
msgid "When you use the chat on this site, your messages and the files you attach go to our help desk at %s. So does an email address or order number you enter in the chat; with an order number, the help desk also receives the order's email address and name. While a conversation is open, the chat sends the path of the page you are viewing. If you are logged in, the chat tells the help desk your account's user ID, name and email address."
msgstr "Wenn Sie den Chat auf dieser Website nutzen, gehen Ihre Nachrichten und die Dateien, die Sie anhängen, an unseren Helpdesk unter %s. Das gilt auch für eine E-Mail-Adresse oder Bestellnummer, die Sie im Chat eingeben; bei einer Bestellnummer erhält der Helpdesk zusätzlich die E-Mail-Adresse und den Namen aus der Bestellung. Solange ein Gespräch geöffnet ist, sendet der Chat den Pfad der Seite, die Sie gerade ansehen. Wenn Sie angemeldet sind, teilt der Chat dem Helpdesk die Benutzer-ID, den Namen und die E-Mail-Adresse Ihres Kontos mit."

#: includes/class-lcff-privacy.php:46
msgid "The chat stores nothing in your browser until you send a message. Then it keeps a random chat token and a few small settings in your browser's storage (`lcff_token`, `lcff_seen`, `lcff_ask`, `lcff_acct`, `lcff_page`), so the conversation continues on other pages. When you log out of this site, a cookie (`lcff_logout`, 10 minutes) tells the chat to close the conversation in this browser."
msgstr "Der Chat speichert nichts in Ihrem Browser, bis Sie eine Nachricht senden. Danach legt er einen zufälligen Chat-Token und einige kleine Einstellungen im Speicher Ihres Browsers ab (`lcff_token`, `lcff_seen`, `lcff_ask`, `lcff_acct`, `lcff_page`), damit das Gespräch auf anderen Seiten weitergeht. Wenn Sie sich von dieser Website abmelden, sorgt ein Cookie (`lcff_logout`, 10 Minuten) dafür, dass der Chat das Gespräch in diesem Browser beendet."

#: includes/class-lcff-privacy.php:49
msgid "Add how long your help desk keeps chat conversations."
msgstr "Ergänzen Sie, wie lange Ihr Helpdesk Chat-Gespräche aufbewahrt."

#: includes/class-lcff-privacy.php:34
msgid "10 minutes"
msgstr "10 Minuten"

#: includes/class-lcff-privacy.php:35
msgid "Tells the chat to close the conversation in this browser after you log out of this site."
msgstr "Sagt dem Chat, das Gespräch in diesem Browser zu beenden, nachdem Sie sich von dieser Website abgemeldet haben."
